"""Native half-profile member span between explicit physical cut planes.

Consumes the existing Section/chain curve contract. Original curve controls,
handles and dimensional laws are read, never reconstructed from a straight
chord. Smooth offset boundaries combine a 1 mm analytic chord certificate with
a 1 mm piecewise-linear reconstruction certificate. Their mesh rows are uniform
in physical axis distance. Exact-mode boundary corners remain mandatory rows.

This candidate supports an axis-monotone span with positive separated width.
It is a reusable surface primitive, not an alternative input preparation or
permission to bypass the complete Bundle contact/ownership checks.
"""
import bpy

